TITLE:: Slc
summary:: Simple wrapper for SLiCE that returns a Pdef/Pbind combo.
categories:: Live Coding, Patterns
related:: Classes/SLiCE, Classes/Pdef, Classes/Pbind

DESCRIPTION::
A simple addition to the SLiCE live coding environmen that saves us from having to write the very useful Pdef/Pbind combination.

Usage:
code::
Slc(
	\name,
	\note, Pseq([0, 1, 2, 3], inf)
).play;
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
argument:: key
A unique identifier symbol for the pattern.
argument:: ... args
Key-value pairs for the Pbind.new

See the documentation for Pdef and Pbind for more detailed info.